            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The day-to-day management and support of patients undergoing a total laryngectomy has led multi-disciplinary nursing teams to create a therapeutic patient education programme aiming to improve the quality of care and the autonomy of these people. In this context, the eb2® dummy is an essential tool.</AbstractText>
